a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-04T15:57:05-08:00","id":1474006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1473803-without-recourse?p=1473983#post1473983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you mean &quot;have you ever had a job?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Your answer implies that virtually everyone who has held a job has faced a situation that poses serious problems for them, for which there is no recourse. I tend to agree. A lot of employers craft abusive contracts that in-need job candidates have little choice but to sign. One of the worst of which I know personally was a model being contractually required to keep her weight below a level that is considered healthy for her height. Otherwise, telemarketing call centers encouraging entry level workers to lie, exaggerate or hide information to close deals. <br /> <br /> Is the workplace where most people are most likely to or most often encounter a situation described by the Original Post? You could say that many kids face a situation at home or at school where some recourse exists, but has consequences attached to it that discourage them from making the call. Being placed in the foster care system and being prevented from seeing one or both parents for many years could be the consequence of reporting abuse at home. This occurs before entering the job market, unless the parents are also part of a cult that uses child labor. <br /> <br /> Crime and police corruption impose situations on people outside of work or family life. It is often neighborhood-focused. In Italy, Mafia corruption is rampant and that is a Western Democracy. Business owners must pay taxes to both the government and the Mafia. <br /> <br /> As someone who goes on tangents and enjoys free-flow conversation, I'm not confining people in the replies to strict subject parameters. A story about a situation where someone thought they had no recourse, but found or even created one is totally welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}